<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <title>Cookie Policy · Slow Down 4 Sam</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Cookie policy for Slow Down 4 Sam, a Michigan nonprofit honoring Sam Gross through motorcycle safety and youth programs.">
    <meta property="og:title" content="Cookie Policy · Slow Down 4 Sam" />
    <meta property="og:description" content="Cookie policy for Slow Down 4 Sam, a Michigan nonprofit honoring Sam Gross through motorcycle safety and youth programs." />
    <%- include('_global_meta'); %>
  </head>
  <body>
    <%- include('_header'); %>
    <main id="main">
      <section class="page-hero">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="eyebrow">Legal</div>
          <h1>Cookie Policy</h1>
          <p>This cookie policy outlines how Slow Down 4 Sam uses “cookies” and other similar technologies, in connection with our site and related services.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="section-head">
            <div class="eyebrow" style="color:var(--green-2)">Basics</div>
            <h2>What is a cookie?</h2>
            <p>Cookies are small text files stored in a computer's browser directory. They help website providers with understanding how people use a website, remembering user login details, and storing website preferences.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section alt">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="section-head">
            <div class="eyebrow" style="color:var(--green-2)">Use</div>
            <h2>Does Slow Down 4 Sam use cookies?</h2>
            <p>Yes we do use cookies to keep the site working and to understand how people visit it.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="grid grid-3">
            <article class="card">
              <div class="kicker">01</div>
              <h3>Function</h3>
              <p>Ensure that services function properly.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="card">
              <div class="kicker">02</div>
              <h3>Understanding</h3>
              <p>Understand how visitors use our website.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="card">
              <div class="kicker">03</div>
              <h3>Improvement</h3>
              <p>Analyse and improve services.</p>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="section-head">
            <div class="eyebrow" style="color:var(--green-2)">Who sets them</div>
            <h2>Who sets cookies when I use Slow Down 4 Sam's site?</h2>
            <p>There are two types of cookies that are set.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="grid grid-2">
            <article class="card">
              <div class="kicker">First party</div>
              <h3>Slow Down 4 Sam</h3>
              <p>These cookies are placed and read by Slow Down 4 Sam directly when you use our services.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="card">
              <div class="kicker">Third party</div>
              <h3>Other companies</h3>
              <p>These cookies are not set by Slow Down 4 Sam. They are set by other companies, like Google, for website analytic purposes.</p>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section alt">
        <div class="container card dark">
          <div class="eyebrow">Slow Down 4 Sam</div>
          <h2>A Michigan non-profit in honor of Sam Gross.</h2>
          <p>Teaching motorcycle safety to young adults. Website: https://slowdown4sam.org · Email: contact@slowdown4sam.org · Location: Michigan, United States.</p>
          <div class="actions">
            <a class="btn btn-light" href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>
            <a class="btn btn-light" href="/cookies">Cookie Policy</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>
    <%- include('_footer'); %>
  </body>
</html>
